{"seq":2,"slug":"mediation","title":"调解","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/conflict-resolution/mediation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mediation-process","title":"调解流程与原则 Mediation Process and Principles","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/conflict-resolution/mediation/mediation-process","wordCount":3523,"readingTime":15},{"seq":2,"slug":"facilitative-mediation","title":"促进式调解 Facilitative Mediation","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/conflict-resolution/mediation/facilitative-mediation","wordCount":3749,"readingTime":15},{"seq":3,"slug":"workplace-mediation","title":"职场冲突调解 Workplace Mediation","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/conflict-resolution/mediation/workplace-mediation","wordCount":3731,"readingTime":15}],"introMarkdown":"# 调解\n\n调解是由中立第三方协助冲突各方达成共识的结构化过程。与仲裁和诉讼不同，调解的核心特征是自愿性和当事人自主决策——调解人不做裁判，而是通过引导对话帮助各方找到彼此可接受的解决方案。\n\n本章涵盖调解的核心流程与原则、促进式调解的专业技术，以及职场冲突调解的特殊场景应用。调解既是一种专业服务，也是每位管理者和团队成员都应具备的基础能力。\n"}